# SmartCart Live Optimizer

## Goal
Transform the SmartCart Wishlist page into an interactive optimizer where users can see all buying options for their wishlist items, compare prices across stores, and manually select their preferred option (overriding the "best price" default).

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> This change will regroup the Wishlist view. Instead of a simple list, it will be a "Control Center" where every item shows multiple buying options.

## Proposed Changes

### [src/pages/consumer/SmartCartWishlist.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/SmartCartWishlist.tsx)
#### [MODIFY] SmartCartWishlist.tsx
-   **New Logic**:
    -   Create a [buildGlobalProductDatabaseByName](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/SmartCartWishlist.tsx#7-39) helper to map `ProductName -> Array<StoreOptions>`.
    -   Initialize a `selections` state that defaults to the cheapest store for every item.
    -   **[Complete]** Enforce "Auto-Optimize" default: Always select the cheapest store unless manually overridden, preventing stuck/stale selections.
    -   Add [handleSelectionChange(productName, storeId)](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/SmartCartWishlist.tsx#123-126) to update the user's choice.
-   **New UI**:
    -   **Item Cards**: Each wishlist item becomes a card.
    -   **Option List**: Inside the card, list all stores selling that item.
        -   Radio button logic for selection.
        -   Badges for "Best Price" 🏆 and "Your Choice" ✅.
    -   **Savings Calculator**: Update the total cost and savings based on the *current* selection, not just the theoretical best.

### [src/pages/consumer/Cart.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/Cart.tsx)
#### [MODIFY] Cart.tsx
-   **Structure Change**: Switch from single column stack to responsive grid.
    -   **Mobile**: Stacked layout (Items above, Summary below).
    -   **Desktop**: Grid layout (Items Left 2/3, Summary Right 1/3).
-   **Summary Card**:
    -   Remove `fixed bottom-20` styles on desktop.
    -   Make it a `sticky top-4` card in the right column.
    -   Keep it distinct with a border/shadow to separate it from items.

### [src/pages/consumer/SmartCartWishlist.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/SmartCartWishlist.tsx)
#### [MODIFY] SmartCartWishlist.tsx
-   **Refactor**: Apply the same Responsive Grid Layout (lg:grid-cols-12) used in Cart.
    -   **Align**: Move Header/Banner above the grid so columns align at the top.
    -   **Items Column** (lg:col-span-8): Main wishlist items list.
    -   **Summary Column** (lg:col-span-4): "Estimated Total" card.
-   **Fix Overlap**: Remove `fixed bottom-[4rem]` style. Convert to a sticky card in the right column on desktop.
